  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "SBOM for DSH",
      "text": "> CycloneDX 1.5 SBOM from a package and its top-level installed dependencies. No network, no full\n> transitive resolution, no vulnerability claims."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```bash\nnode bin/dsh-sbom.mjs . --json --output sbom.json\nnode bin/dsh-sbom.mjs . --json | head\n```\n\nIn DSH:\n\n```text\nUse sbom_export on this package, format=json.\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Output",
      "text": "- `metadata.component`: root application\n- `components[]`: top-level installed `node_modules` libraries with name, version, license, purl"
    },
    {
      "section": "Limits",
      "text": "- Installed top-level packages only\n- No transitive graph, lockfile-only resolution, vulnerability DB, or signatures\n- Not a complete supply-chain attestation"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tests",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm test\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Provenance",
      "text": "A small independent CycloneDX emitter. License: MIT."
    }
